{
  "_comment": [
    "Employers whose applicant-tracking system publishes an open, keyless job",
    "board. Every slug in this file was fetched and confirmed to return real",
    "JSON with a non-zero job count on 2026-07-28; the job counts recorded here",
    "are that day's reading and are kept only as evidence the slug was live",
    "when it was added. They are not used by the collector.",
    "",
    "Adding an employer: fetch the board endpoint by hand first. All three APIs",
    "answer 200 with an EMPTY list for a slug that does not exist, so a slug",
    "that was mistyped looks exactly like an employer with nothing open. The",
    "collector treats a board that drops to zero as a breakage for that reason.",
    "",
    "  greenhouse       https://boards-api.greenhouse.io/v1/boards/{slug}/jobs",
    "  ashby            https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/{slug}",
    "  smartrecruiters  https://api.smartrecruiters.com/v1/companies/{slug}/postings",
    "",
    "Company names are the employer's own spelling: Greenhouse returns it as",
    "company_name on every posting, and the Ashby and SmartRecruiters entries",
    "were spelled from the employer's own careers site. A name is never derived",
    "from the slug ('scaleai' is not 'Scaleai')."
  ],
